dho:Accompanies a dho:ConditionRelation ;
    rdfs:label "accompanies the development of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "X-sahagata: the awakening factor is developed accompanied by X (SN 46.57-76). The condition is X, the conditioned is the awakening factors. Sujato's English turns the grammar round ('develops X together with the awakening factors'); the Pali is followed (D15 correction, D19)."@en .

